== Trivia ==
* Clots are a miniature version of [[Gish]], from [http://store.steampowered.com/app/9500/ the game of the same name].
* The I in I.Blob stands for Isaac, referencing their similarities to Isaac.
* {{dlc|r}} [[Anti:Grilled Clotty|Grilled Clotties]] originate from the ''Antibirth'' mod.

